lcError(f\"unexpected character {ch!r}\")\ncalc.errors.CalcError: unexpected character 'm'\n\n======================================================================\nERROR: test_parens_unary (tests.test_calc.T.test_parens_unary)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/private/var/folders/0r/cvjfflsx01g6z8zy2wlgf6dm0000gn/T/flashback_opencode_work/mini_oc_qwen_36_cpu/calc_language_r2/tests/test_calc.py\", line 15, in test_parens_unary\n    self.assertEqual(calc(\"-(1 + 2) * 3\"), -9)\n                     ~~~~^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/private/var/folders/0r/cvjfflsx01g6z8zy2wlgf6dm0000gn/T/flashback_opencode_work/mini_oc_qwen_36_cpu/calc_language_r2/calc/__init__.py\", line 7, in calc\n    return evaluate(parse(tokenize(src)), env or {})\n                          ~~~~~~~~^^^^^\n  File \"/private/var/folders/0r/cvjfflsx01g6z8zy2wlgf6dm0000gn/T/flashback_opencode_work/mini_oc_qwen_36_cpu/calc_language_r2/calc/lexer.py\", line 21, in tokenize\n    raise CalcError(f\"unexpected character {ch!r}\")\ncalc.errors.CalcError: unexpected character '('\n\n======================================================================\nERROR: test_power (tests.test_calc.T.test_power)\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \"/private/var/folders/0r/cvjfflsx01g6z8zy2wlgf6dm0000gn/T/flashback_opencode_work/mini_oc_qwen_36_cpu/calc_language_r2/tests/test_calc.py\", line 18, in test_power\n    self.assertEqual(calc(\"-2**2\"), -4)\n                     ~~~~^^^^^^^^^\n  File \"/private/var/folders/0r/cvjfflsx01g6z8zy2wlgf6dm0000gn/T/flashback_opencode_work/mini_oc_qwen_36_cpu/calc_language_r2/calc/__init__.py\", line 7, in calc\n    return evaluate(parse(tokenize(src)), env or {})\n                          ~~~~~~~~^^^^^\n  File \"/private/var/folders/0r/cvjfflsx01g6z8zy2wlgf6dm0000gn/T/flashback_opencode_work/mini_oc_qwen_36_cpu/calc_la